# host 2026-11-15 19:03 (recording 20261115_165356): a screenshot next to the
# game. Spectacle's region picker covers both monitors for 2.5 s, so every
# window under it counts as hidden; its buffers ask for the focus's headroom
# and Chrome, playing on monitor 2 until that moment, gives 572 MB. The picker
# closes, Chrome is visible again and draws from sysmem: 11-15 GB/s of PCIe,
# the card at 167 W instead of 334, the game at 2-7 frames a second, every RM
# call 300 ms. Chrome did not come back for 45 s (until it was clicked):
# 2787 MB were free and "its memory + the focus's headroom + hysteresis" is
# 2876. A window that is shown and takes a good share of the GPU from sysmem
# costs the focus far more than a headroom short of its mark.
# Since 2026-11-16 the picker gets no headroom at all: a new process with a
# fullscreen window is not a game for its first seconds, and an app's headroom
# waits until it has been in focus for 3 s; Chrome gives nothing.
cap 11000
proc 1614 kwin_wayland old
proc 1625 plasmashell old
proc 5000 Wow.exe old chunk=64
proc 7000 chrome old chunk=32
proc 2094 ghostty old chunk=8
proc 9000 claude-desktop old chunk=16

hint 1625 v
hint 5000 f launched full
hint 7000 v
hint 2094 v
hint 9000 h
act 1614 0 4
act 1625 0 4
act 5000 0 40
act 7000 0 4
act 2094 1 0
act 9000 300 0
target 1614 280 0.75
target 1625 480 0.4
target 5000 6800 0.75
target 7000 1045 0.8
target 2094 240 0.7
place 9000 110 283 0.9
at 20
expect sys 7000 == 0

mark the region picker covers both monitors
proc 4009 spectacle chunk=32
hint 4009 f full
hint 5000 h launched full
hint 7000 h
hint 2094 h
hint 1625 h
step
target 4009 320 0.9
at 22
expect evicted 7000 == 0         # it gave 572 MB for the picker's headroom that evening

mark the picker closes: the game is in focus again, Chrome and the terminal are shown; Chrome draws from sysmem
free 4009 320
hint 4009 -
hint 5000 f launched full
hint 7000 v
hint 2094 v
hint 1625 v
act 7000 0 12
act 2094 1 0
step
at 24
act 7000 0 14
at 28
expect sys 7000 == 0             # nothing out, nothing to bring back (it was back within seconds since 2026-11-15)
expect restores 7000 == 0

mark the game streams on with less than its headroom free; Chrome keeps playing
target 5000 7000 0.75 spread=20
at 90
expect sys 7000 == 0
expect evicts 7000 == 0          # not for the picker, and not for the game's streaming
expect player_hitches 5000 == 0  # the player's view: nothing of the driver's in the game's way
expect sys 5000 == 0
